= Extraordinary Party Congress announcement

In response to the growing influence of the Left of Center movement, Kemal Satır has called for an extraordinary party congress to address individuals "who want to sway <span style="color: #E3000F;">**CHP**</span> away from its Kemalist roots."

İnönü has reluctantly accepted the proposal, and the party is now approaching what may be its most significant congress in decades, a meeting that will determine the future direction of both the party and the nation.

- @letsgo: Bring it on.

